<title>USA: New York Bagel Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>New York Bagel Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thirteen Weeks Ended</p>
<p>							Mar 30,     Mar 31,</p>
<p>							  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Total revenues				 4,474,649   2,388,725</p>
<p> Net earnings				     259,046     156,239</p>
<p> Net earnings per share			    0.06	  0.05</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding    4,667,500   3,018,538</p>
<p>NOTE:  New York Bagel Enterprises Inc said the increase in the weighted average shares outstanding in the first fiscal quarter of 1997 to 4,667,500 from 3,018,538 was due to the company's initial public offering in August 1996.</p>
<p>The company reported pro forma net earnings for the first quarter of 1996 to reflect what net income would have been if the company had not operated as an S corporation during such period. The company terminated its S corporation status in connection with its initial public offering in August 1996.</p>
</text>
